  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Audit what text left the VPC",
      "items": [
        "Every model call is written to litellm-db before egress — nothing can bypass it",
        "Table LiteLLM_SpendLogs holds messages and response: the full prompt and the full reply",
        "Also request_id, startTime, model, api_key (which app), tokens, spend, status, requester_ip_address",
        "Volume sarmad-dmz_litellm_pg on the DMZ; read it with: docker compose exec litellm-db psql -U litellm -d litellm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Single egress, by construction",
      "items": [
        "App and DB have no route to the internet at all",
        "App reaches OpenRouter only through LiteLLM on the DMZ",
        "App reaches the customer SSO only through DMZ nginx on :8082",
        "The relay forwards to openrouter.ai and stores no credentials — the API key never leaves the VPC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Other logs and facts on the DMZ",
      "items": [
        "nginx access and error logs — who called the public endpoints",
        "docker compose logs per container: litellm, bubble-chat-api, tts, feedback-report",
        "Wildcard cert *.sarmadins.ir (Certum) expires 26 Jan 2027",
        "postgres holds chat, user, model, knowledge, file and config tables",
        "Prompt bodies are insurance-customer conversations: add a purge job before this becomes a liability"
      ]
    }
  ]
